"""
04_postprocess_outputs.py
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Control Rationalisation — Step 4 of 4: Post-processing and Output Generation
Dimension 1: Product-level cluster assessment

Purpose:
  Reads all checkpoint JSONL files from Script 3 parallel runs.
  Merges and deduplicates every assessment.
  Where the same control was assessed in multiple sub-batches, keeps the
  most substantive finding using this priority:
    Redundant > Process-Split Fragmentation > Common Control Opportunity
    > Unclear > Retain
  Identifies any controls in the scope that received no assessment.
  Produces two output workbooks for SME review.

Outputs:
  within_product_assessment.xlsx  — main SME output, one row per control
  assessment_summary.xlsx         — statistics and coverage report

Run:
  python 04_postprocess_outputs.py
  python 04_postprocess_outputs.py --suffix _sample   # sample run only
"""

